{"id":1048,"bodyHtml":"<div><div><div><p>为扎实做好暑期学生管理，筑牢假期安全防线，6月22日下午，我院在15101H教室召开暑期教育主题班会，本次班会由我院团委书记刘莉莉主持，研一研二学生参加。</p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=2oR-dYnmUDL4NiL-zWkUzlaMm9iMzrW2ozGZU4v4L4GZoz70gihFp2hmCIa0oSh7U1yboShfnzWVUmn7nzT7nR-iU8nVoRNPM7LDM8CYnRVFU8C4L4NZUmTFUNUDLSb/v2rjo4OeoDiAvjAXvD80qIbtpYyPLRGYg4v4M4lJqdHnx&oid=1579047909&tid=1002&nid=7375&e=.jpeg\" xmlns:v=\"urn:schemas-microsoft-com:vml\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/9DB99AE2EB4DE9DD25CDE8914C67F2D1/CF3398B9/BD61\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\" 520px\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=2oR-dYnmUDL4NiL-zWkUzlaMm9iMzrW2ozGZU4v4L4GZoz70gihFp2hmCIa0oSh7U1yboShfnzWVUmn7nzT7nR-iU8nVoRNPM7LDM8CYnRVFU8C4L4NZUmTFUNUDLSb/v2rjo4OeoDiAvjAXvD80qIbtpYyPLRGYg4v4M4lJqdHnx&oid=1579047909&tid=1002&nid=7375&e=.jpeg\"></p><p>会上，刘老师重点部署假期安全与离校管理工作。她要求全体同学严格履行离校请假手续，离校前做好宿舍断电、门窗关锁等内务工作；同时提醒大家提高自我防护意识，出行、居家时刻绷紧安全弦，规避各类安全风险，落实个人安全主体责任。此外，她叮嘱大家科学分配假期时间，合理规划学习与生活节奏，充实度过暑期时光。</p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=2U4fdfLRCPolLYM-RGDLRGYnlC8M4TWknmrfo7n7U4WknR-0gihFp2hmCIa0USybn1hfU1hRLznkMNUsMl7iLlM7ozGsLRCZUlCbnl7DU8VFU8U8LmQ2L8VFnRL8Lkb/v2rjo4OeoDiAvjAXvD80qIbtpYyPLRGYg4v4M4lJqdHnx&oid=1579047909&tid=1002&nid=7375&e=.jpeg\" xmlns:v=\"urn:schemas-microsoft-com:vml\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/A9FABC14B6D75A51CD907068AF9EA6CA/CD426F3A/D340\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\" 524px\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=2U4fdfLRCPolLYM-RGDLRGYnlC8M4TWknmrfo7n7U4WknR-0gihFp2hmCIa0USybn1hfU1hRLznkMNUsMl7iLlM7ozGsLRCZUlCbnl7DU8VFU8U8LmQ2L8VFnRL8Lkb/v2rjo4OeoDiAvjAXvD80qIbtpYyPLRGYg4v4M4lJqdHnx&oid=1579047909&tid=1002&nid=7375&e=.jpeg\"></p><p>本次班会进一步提升了同学们的安全防范意识，也为大家规划假期生活提供清晰指引，祝愿同学们度过一个愉快且充实的假期。</p></div></div></div>","bodyText":"","attachments":[],"image":"http://mkszyxy.nuc.edu.cn/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=2oR-dYnmUDL4NiL-zWkUzlaMm9iMzrW2ozGZU4v4L4GZoz70gihFp2hmCIa0oSh7U1yboShfnzWVUmn7nzT7nR-iU8nVoRNPM7LDM8CYnRVFU8C4L4NZUmTFUNUDLSb/v2rjo4OeoDiAvjAXvD80qIbtpYyPLRGYg4v4M4lJqdHnx&oid=1579047909&tid=1002&nid=7375&e=.jpeg"}